# single point + short NVT with pair_style metatomic (kk) on the 256-atom Al-Li liquid cell; MODEL and DATA replaced by sed
units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
read_data DATA
mass 1 26.9815
mass 2 6.94
pair_style metatomic MODEL
pair_coeff * * 13 3
thermo_style custom step temp pe press
thermo 10
run 0
velocity all create 1100.0 12345
fix 1 all nvt temp 1100.0 1100.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 50
